  "limitations": [
    "Translating whole-robot mass allowance, equal leg loads, constant vertical COM acceleration. Body rotation, contacts and link/shaft/hub inertia are omitted.",
    "Both legs are assumed to use the new spring. The main viewer has only the left spring study, so this is not a model of that mixed assembly.",
    "The 32A propeller-cooled motor figure is only an optimistic screening ceiling for a sealed hip. FOC parameter, cooling, driver and battery identification remain open.",
    "Stock gear inertia is included; hub and shaft inertia, backlash, bearings and impact loads still require the finished CAD and plant.",
    "No manufacturer torque/fatigue rating has been established for these gears at this duty.",
    "A passing row does not establish the 250mm wheel-clearance requirement or stable landing. A failing row does not prove the hardware cannot jump with another force/time profile."
  ]
